  "id": "deinstitutionalization",
  "term": "deinstitutionalization",
  "definition": "Deinstitutionalization is a rights-based shift in mental health policy away from institutional and coercive forms of care. In this context, it emphasizes support in place of involuntary hospitalization and restraint, along with greater participation and supported decision-making for people with lived experience.",
